@startuml
title Agent Teams Workflow v2 — service-key authority concentration
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFAF8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #553C35
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Embers trust boundary" #FFF0DB {
  component "One configured service_key\n(EMBERS__..__SERVICE_KEY)" as key #FFD5AC
}

package "Chain identity" #E7F3E7 {
  component "serviceAddress\n(env bootstrap)" as ident #B9DCBE
}
package "Command authority" #E7F3E7 {
  component "advanceRun / clearCommand\nself-signed timerFired" as cmd #B9DCBE
}
package "Deploy + attestation" #E7F3E7 {
  component "effect / guard deploys\nobservation ECDSA" as deploy #B9DCBE
}
package "Secret custody" #EEE6F8 {
  component "AES encryption_key" as enc #DDD0F0
  component "HMAC capability_key\n(config enforces the two differ)" as cap #DDD0F0
}

key --> ident
key --> cmd
key --> deploy
key --> enc
key --> cap

note right of key #FAD8D8
Compromise radius: advance any run through
arbitrary transitions, forge observations,
decrypt every artifact, derive any capability,
fire any timer, claim any command class.
end note
note bottom of cmd #FFF6C9
Outside the radius: finishRun is owner-only;
cannot sign as an owner wallet; cannot replace
a registry entry without that team's registry key.
end note
@enduml
